~ start
The Keeper: Ah… you're awake.
The Keeper: Good. I was beginning to think I'd have to find another botanist.
The Keeper: Don't look so frightened.
The Keeper: If I wanted you dead, we wouldn't be having this conversation.
do UIManager.open_blink()
The Keeper: My name is The Keeper.
The Keeper: Yours doesn't matter. Not yet.
The Keeper: I have only one request.
The Keeper: Grow Mandrakes for me.

- Why me?
	The Keeper: Because you're a botanist.
	The Keeper: You understand how to keep fragile things alive.
	The Keeper: That's all I require.
- Where am I?
	The Keeper: Somewhere you cannot leave.
	The Keeper: The walls know their purpose.
	The Keeper: So do the doors.
- What are you?
	The Keeper: …
	The Keeper: A keeper.
	The Keeper: Isn't that enough?

The Keeper: Your tools are ready.
The Keeper: Your first seeds are waiting.
The Keeper: Your garden is prepared.
The Keeper: Everything you need has already been provided.
The Keeper: Today, it is free.
The Keeper: Don't mistake that for kindness.
The Keeper: Nothing is ever free twice.
The Keeper: Eventually…
The Keeper: Everything finds its way back to me.
The Keeper: Now.
The Keeper: Grow.
=> END